# Secret Tunnel's two targets must be creatures Bot1 controls that share a creature type (CR 115.1, 601.2c, 205.3m). Bot1's
# Water Tribe Captain (Human Soldier Ally) and Ornithopter (Thopter) share none, so that pair is refused; Bot2's Kyoshi Warriors
# (Human Warrior Ally) shares types with the Captain but Bot2 controls it, so it is no candidate, and Bot2's two Ornithopters
# (Thopters, sharing a type with each other) are refused as a pair for the same reason; the Captain alone is one target short,
# and the Captain, Protectors and Fire Nation Cadets (three Human Soldiers) are one too many. The positive control is the
# Captain with Bot1's own Earth Kingdom Protectors (Human Soldier Ally), taken last.

[Bot1 Deck]
Secret Tunnel
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Water Tribe Captain
Earth Kingdom Protectors
Fire Nation Cadets
Ornithopter
Mox Emerald
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Kyoshi Warriors
Ornithopter x2
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Secret Tunnel.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Water Tribe Captain.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Kyoshi Warriors.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Earth Kingdom Protectors.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Fire Nation Cadets.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Secret Tunnel.Activate(Ability: share)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Water Tribe Captain; Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Kyoshi Warriors)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Water Tribe Captain)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Water Tribe Captain; Bot1.Battlefield.Earth Kingdom Protectors; Bot1.Battlefield.Fire Nation Cadets)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Water Tribe Captain; Bot1.Battlefield.Earth Kingdom Protectors)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Secret Tunnel.Tapped = true
